<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Transition Systems.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Transition Systems.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it initiated coverage of Transition Systems Inc as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $20 a share.</p>
<p>-- expects Transition Systems to earn $0.55 a share in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Transition Systems gained 7/8 to 14.</p>
